  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a medium saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the cocoa powder and whisk until well combined.",
    "Add the coconut milk and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let cook for 5 minutes, whisking constantly.",
    "Add the honey, vanilla extract, and salt, and whisk until the honey is dissolved.",
    "Stir in the cocoa nibs and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Mash the bananas in a separate bowl and stir in the coconut flakes.",
    "To assemble the bowls, divide the cocoa mixture between two stoneware bowls, then top with the mashed banana mixture and a sprinkle of chopped fresh mint.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
